        "original_id": "06797edc-cf51-5e25-9fd9-719df1acac40",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Mawson, South Australia, City of Onkaparinga, Adelaide\n- Organizations: House of Assembly\n- Topics: electoral districts, wine regions\n\nFacts:\n- Mawson is an electoral district of the House of Assembly in the Australian state of South Australia.\n- Mawson covers most of the outer southern suburbs of the City of Onkaparinga, including Hackham, Hackham West, Huntfield Heights, Noarlunga Downs, Old Noarlunga, Onkaparinga Hills, Seaford Heights, the Noarlunga Centre shopping area, parts of Woodcroft, and the southern wine region around McLaren Vale and Willunga.\n- McLaren Vale is a wine region in South Australia approximately 35 km south of Adelaide.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
